    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Masks of the Void</strong>\u00a0is a Rogue-lite action-RPG where you use powerful masks that grant you unique powers. Player's can level up their skills and swap them out for better ones as their journey continues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Key Features for full release</strong>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Telekinesis based bullet heaven: </strong>Use the world at your will. Use everything in the environment, even the walls!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build up your way: with </strong>3 different gameplay classes, build up your character with random objects within each game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your actions matter:\u00a0</strong>The more consumed by the power you become, the more chaotic the world reacts to you. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/a490f7a2b250499b6a979b9f1daf490f.poster.avif?t=1752506089\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/a490f7a2b250499b6a979b9f1daf490f.webm?t=1752506089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/a490f7a2b250499b6a979b9f1daf490f.mp4?t=1752506089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unique story unfolds, that sees Iret try to save her Boreal Island home under imminent threat by the realm-eating god-like being, the Neverending Night. Guided by her adopted father, Dr. Herdesett, Iret gains access to the Sand Masks with the help of a mysterious stranger. Repeatedly travelling to the storm-battered Vortex, a fragmented dimension closest to the Entity, Iret comes face to face with powerful warped Echoes and a darker future self.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/089f046574475e6fea26d676edf835fc.poster.avif?t=1752506089\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/089f046574475e6fea26d676edf835fc.webm?t=1752506089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/089f046574475e6fea26d676edf835fc.mp4?t=1752506089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iret must gain not only enough Void Masks, power, and skill to vanquish the Neverending Night for good, but also enlist the aid of secretive supporting characters she will encounter along the way. Time and time again, Iret will have to face the potent dangers on her repeated journeys through the dangerous Vortex and Astral Planes until, at last, she is ready to face the Entity. How and when she will finish her fight with the Neverending Night depends on the choices she made in the previous loops. The balance between light and dark is key in allowing Iret to understand how to harness the Mask of the Void\u2019s ultimate power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/b22e69ff882d0696ed676df1461c6f5a.poster.avif?t=1752506089\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/b22e69ff882d0696ed676df1461c6f5a.webm?t=1752506089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/b22e69ff882d0696ed676df1461c6f5a.mp4?t=1752506089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Masks of the Void</strong>\u00a0is a Rogue-lite action-RPG where you use powerful masks that grant you unique powers. Player's can level up their skills and swap them out for better ones as their journey continues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Key Features for full release</strong>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Telekinesis based bullet heaven: </strong>Use the world at your will. Use everything in the environment, even the walls!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build up your way: with </strong>3 different gameplay classes, build up your character with random objects within each game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your actions matter:\u00a0</strong>The more consumed by the power you become, the more chaotic the world reacts to you. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/a490f7a2b250499b6a979b9f1daf490f.poster.avif?t=1752506089\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/a490f7a2b250499b6a979b9f1daf490f.webm?t=1752506089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/a490f7a2b250499b6a979b9f1daf490f.mp4?t=1752506089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unique story unfolds, that sees Iret try to save her Boreal Island home under imminent threat by the realm-eating god-like being, the Neverending Night. Guided by her adopted father, Dr. Herdesett, Iret gains access to the Sand Masks with the help of a mysterious stranger. Repeatedly travelling to the storm-battered Vortex, a fragmented dimension closest to the Entity, Iret comes face to face with powerful warped Echoes and a darker future self.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/089f046574475e6fea26d676edf835fc.poster.avif?t=1752506089\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/089f046574475e6fea26d676edf835fc.webm?t=1752506089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/089f046574475e6fea26d676edf835fc.mp4?t=1752506089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iret must gain not only enough Void Masks, power, and skill to vanquish the Neverending Night for good, but also enlist the aid of secretive supporting characters she will encounter along the way. Time and time again, Iret will have to face the potent dangers on her repeated journeys through the dangerous Vortex and Astral Planes until, at last, she is ready to face the Entity. How and when she will finish her fight with the Neverending Night depends on the choices she made in the previous loops. The balance between light and dark is key in allowing Iret to understand how to harness the Mask of the Void\u2019s ultimate power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/b22e69ff882d0696ed676df1461c6f5a.poster.avif?t=1752506089\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/b22e69ff882d0696ed676df1461c6f5a.webm?t=1752506089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/b22e69ff882d0696ed676df1461c6f5a.mp4?t=1752506089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "You are Iret, a girl who has obtained this power and with it, the task to prevent a Neverending Night. Empower yourself or your allies in this journey while the world reacts to your decisions and your character grows stronger in a roguelike or roguelite style, all up to you!",
